      <li><strong>A.</strong> Cefotaxime
      <li><strong>B.</strong> Cefepime
      <li><strong>C.</strong> Ceftriaxone
      <li><strong>D.</strong> Ceftazidime
      <li><strong>E.</strong> Ampicillin
    </ul>
